   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Joe,<div><br></div><div>The counts in the object &quot;bwmatrix&quot; were characters instead of integers. Also, your covariates are all considered &quot;siteCovs&quot; by unmarked because they have a single value per site. This code seems to work:</div>\r\n<div><br></div><div><div>bwmatrix &lt;- read.table(file = &quot;bwmatrix.txt&quot;, sep = &quot;\\t&quot;)</div><div>bwFrame &lt;- unmarkedFrameMPois(y=bwmatrix,</div><div>    siteCovs=cbind(bwsitecov, bwobscov),</div>\r\n<div>    type=&quot;removal&quot;) </div><div>summary(bwFrame)</div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><br></div><div># fit models</div><div>fm.bw.1 = multinomPois(~1 ~1, bwFrame)</div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
