     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div>fm.bw.2 = multinomPois(~DOY+MSS ~ Cover, bwFrame)</div><div><br>\r\n</div><div><br></div><div>Hope this helps.</div><div><br></div><div>Richard</div></div></div>"
    ],
