 model and I keep getting the following error message:<br>\r\nError in dpois(x, lambda, log) : <br>\r\n  Non-numeric argument to mathematical function<br>\r\nAnyone know what this is about?<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thanks!<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Joe<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div></div>"
